# Use case: drawing the map and the regions. Mexican states, 1940-2000

Run this notebook from a git checkout of Spatex: it installs Spatex from the checkout (`path:`).

## Setup

> **Not run in CI.** GeoFrame is not on Hex yet, so CI does not fetch it.
> Run this notebook locally with a GeoFrame checkout:
>
> ```
> SPATEX_GEOFRAME_PATH=/path/to/geoframe livebook server notebooks/mexico_case.livemd
> ```
>
> or headlessly, to check that every cell works:
